.TH sam-jail-compat 1 2026-11-10 "SAM 0.1.0" "SAM Manual"
.SH NAME
sam\-jail\-compat \- Turn compatibility mode on or off. Off restores the settings from before it was turned on
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsam\-jail compat\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIAPP\fR> <\fISTATE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Turn compatibility mode on or off. Off restores the settings from before it was turned on
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIAPP\fR>

.TP
<\fISTATE\fR>

